Description:
libwebm is used to parse WebM/Matroska container data.

Local Changes:
* Removed unused "mkvmuxer" components.
* Removed unused "file_util", "hdr_util", "mkv_reader" and related sources.
* Made "IMkvReader" destructor public.
* Updated parser sources for modern C++ compatibility.
